        .about("Initialize a StGit stack on a branch")
        .long_about(
            "Initialize a StGit stack on a branch.\n\
             \n\
             Initializing a branch with a StGit stack commits initial, empty stack state for the \
             branch to the repository. Theses stack metadata commits are tracked by the \
             `refs/stacks/<branch>` reference. Updated stack state is committed by each StGit \
             command that modifies the stack. StGit users do not have to do anything with the \
             `refs/stacks/<branch>` ref directly.\n\
             \n\
