             initialize the stack, so it is often not necessary to explicitly initialize the stack \
             on a branch. Also, branches created with `stg branch --create` are automatically \
             initialized.\n\
             \n\
             The branch must already exist and point to a commit before initializing a StGit \
             stack.\n\
             \n\
