             updates, and then merges that patch into the patch you asked to have refreshed. If \
             you asked to refresh a patch other than the topmost patch, there can be conflicts; \
             in that case, the temporary patch will be left for you to take care of, for example \
             with stg squash.\n\
             \n\
             The creation of the temporary patch is recorded in a separate entry in the patch \
             stack log; this means that one undo step will undo the merge between the other \
             patch and the temp patch, and two undo steps will additionally get rid of the temp \
