             the specified branch or series. The command can be used for keeping patches on \
             several branches in sync. Note that the operation may fail for some patches because \
             of conflicts. The patches in the series must apply cleanly.",
        )
        .override_usage("stg sync <--ref-branch=BRANCH|--series=SERIES> [<patch>...|--all]")
        .arg(
